name: sim.auxiliaryConsoleShow
description: Shows or hides an auxiliary console window
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsoleShow(int consoleHandle, bool showState)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.auxiliaryConsoleShow(int consoleHandle, bool showState)
inputs:
1. consoleHandle: handle of the console window, previously returned by sim.auxiliaryConsoleOpen. When combined with sim.handleflag_extended, then the function will simply query the visibility state of the console.
2. showState: indicates whether the console should be hidden (0) or shown (!=0)
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the console doesn't exist (anymore), in which case no error is generated. 1 if the console window's show state was changed.
replacedBy:
- name: visible, class: Console, file: Console_visible.property
